{
    "title": "RE30 - Minimal - Simple",
    "description": "The Recreative Watch is a minimal timepiece that offers customization options and a casual yet stylish appearance.\r\n\r\n <font color=\"#00a675\">Powered by Watch Face Format</font>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8c Write to support@recreative-watch.com for assistance.\r\n\r\n\u2699\ufe0f <font color=\"#00a675\"> Phone App Features</font>\r\n\r\nThis phone app is simply a tool to facilitate installation and locating the watch face on your Wear OS watch. Only the mobile app contains ads.\r\n\r\n\u2699\ufe0f <font color=\"#00a675\"> Watch Face Features</font>\r\n\r\n\u2022 12/24h Digital Time\r\n\u2022 Date\r\n\u2022 Battery\r\n\u2022 Steps Count\r\n\u2022 2 customizable Shortcut\r\n\u2022 3 customizable Complications\r\n\u2022 4x Hands Styles\r\n\u2022 5x Index Styles\r\n\u2022 13x Color Variations\r\n\u2022 Always ON Display supported with changeable colors and changeable modes\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 <font color=\"#00a675\">Customization</font>\r\n\r\n1 - Touch and hold display\r\n2 - Tap on <b>Customize</b> option\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 <font color=\"#00a675\">Complications</font>\r\n\r\n<b>Touch and hold</b> display to open customization mode. You can customize the field with any data you want. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0b <font color=\"#00a675\">Battery </font>\r\n\r\nFor better battery performance of the watch, we recommend disabling the \"Always On Display\" mode.\r\n\r\n\u2705 Compatible devices include <font color=\"#00a675\">API level 33+ Google Pixel, Galaxy Watch 4, 5, 6, 7 and other Wear OS models.</font>\r\n\r\n <font color=\"#E97451\">Installation and troubleshooting</font>\r\nFollow this link: https://www.recreative-watch.com/help/#installation-methodes\r\n\r\n <font color=\"#E97451\">Watch faces don't automatically apply on your watch screen after the installation. That's why you must set it on your watch's screen.</font>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8c Write to support@recreative-watch.com for assistance.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Recreative Watch is a minimal timepiece that offers customization options and a casual yet stylish appearance.<br><br> <font color=\"#00a675\">Powered by Watch Face Format</font><br><br>\ud83d\udc8c Write to support@recreative-watch.com for assistance.<br><br>\u2699\ufe0f <font color=\"#00a675\"> Phone App Features</font><br><br>This phone app is simply a tool to facilitate installation and locating the watch face on your Wear OS watch. Only the mobile app contains ads.<br><br>\u2699\ufe0f <font color=\"#00a675\"> Watch Face Features</font><br><br>\u2022 12/24h Digital Time<br>\u2022 Date<br>\u2022 Battery<br>\u2022 Steps Count<br>\u2022 2 customizable Shortcut<br>\u2022 3 customizable Complications<br>\u2022 4x Hands Styles<br>\u2022 5x Index Styles<br>\u2022 13x Color Variations<br>\u2022 Always ON Display supported with changeable colors and changeable modes<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 <font color=\"#00a675\">Customization</font><br><br>1 - Touch and hold display<br>2 - Tap on <b>Customize</b> option<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 <font color=\"#00a675\">Complications</font><br><br><b>Touch and hold</b> display to open customization mode. You can customize the field with any data you want. <br><br>\ud83d\udd0b <font color=\"#00a675\">Battery </font><br><br>For better battery performance of the watch, we recommend disabling the &quot;Always On Display&quot; mode.<br><br>\u2705 Compatible devices include <font color=\"#00a675\">API level 33+ Google Pixel, Galaxy Watch 4, 5, 6, 7 and other Wear OS models.</font><br><br> <font color=\"#E97451\">Installation and troubleshooting</font><br>Follow this link: https://www.recreative-watch.com/help/#installation-methodes<br><br> <font color=\"#E97451\">Watch faces don&#39;t automatically apply on your watch screen after the installation. That&#39;s why you must set it on your watch&#39;s screen.</font><br><br>\ud83d\udc8c Write to support@recreative-watch.com for assistance.",
